# The program of a point of datalog_point: a Scott sum of six
# constructors, in order: composition, three_way, intersection,
# constant_join, then closure and symmetric, whose one field is the shape
# of their edges (a constructor of mixin_datalog/shape). Read by its
# position (com.yang_bo.gezi.contest.corpora.merges.MixinDatalog, ProgramKind).
λ export
. export
  (λcomposition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. composition)
  (λcomposition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. three_way)
  (λcomposition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. intersection)
  (λcomposition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. constant_join)
  (λshape composition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. closure shape) λshape composition three_way intersection constant_join closure symmetric. symmetric shape
